This Terraform program creates an EKS cluster, an IAM role with an inline policy, an OpenSearch Serverless access policy, and an SSO application access scope. The variables provide default values for the required parameters, ensuring the configuration can be deployed with Terraform ~> 1.9.8 and hashicorp/aws ~> 5.75.

